# Andrew's Blog

This repo contains the content for Andrew's blog. It is published using Pelican.

## Using with Nix

To build the site:

```bash
nix-build
```

The site will be generated in the `result/` directory.

## Deployment

To verify timestamps, build and deploy the site:

```bash
./deploy.sh
```

This script verifies OpenTimestamps files, builds the site with nix-build and deploys it to the configured server.

